<title>UK: Nissan's Gibson joins ASDA as dep. chairman.</title>
<headline>Nissan's Gibson joins ASDA as dep. chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supermarket group ASDA Group Plc said on Wednesday that Ian Gibson, Chief Executive of Nissan, is to become Deputy Chairman of ASDA.</p>
<p>Gibson will be one of two deputy Chairmen, joining Frank Knight who was appointed to this position in June 1993.</p>
<p>Gibson was appointed Chief Executive and Managing Director of Nissan in 1989, developing the Nissan UK operation.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
